   "text": "INJECT / RESTORE are plain shell commands (systemctl stop, virsh destroy, kill -STOP, cpnano -q \u2026). Their timestamps split the results into before / during / after.",
   "originalText": "INJECT / RESTORE are plain shell commands (systemctl stop, virsh destroy, kill -STOP, cpnano -q \u2026). Their timestamps split the results into before / during / after.",
